  "title": "Applesauce Cornbread",
  "description": "This is an easy, quick recipe for applesauce cornbread that's dense, and adjustably sweet. It will smell great as it bakes and comes out with a great golden crust. It can accompany anything. I love it served with salad, soup, or chili. Add herbs for extra flavor.",
